{"text": "It was four oclock in the morning when someone knocked at the street door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Three police officers came in, very politely. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A neighbor had heard a scream during the night, and they had come to search the house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I smiled, for what had I to fear. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I told them the scream was my own, in a dream. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I brought chairs into the old mans room and placed my own chair right above the boards. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The officers were satisfied, and we talked happily about ordinary things. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But soon I felt myself getting pale, and I wished them gone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A ringing began in my ears, a low, dull, quick sound, much like a watch wrapped in cotton. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It grew louder and louder, but the officers chatted pleasantly and smiled. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was it possible they did not hear it, No, no, They heard, and they were making fun of my terror. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I could bear those smiles no longer, and I felt that I must scream or die. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Villains, I shrieked, I admit the deed, Tear up the boards, Here, here, It is the beating of his terrible heart.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "f", "o", "u", "r", " ", "o", "c", "l", "o", "c", "k", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "w", "h", "e", "n", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", "o", "n", "e", " ", "k", "n", "o", "c", "k", "e", "d", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "r", "e", "e", "t", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "r", "e", "e", " ", "p", "o", "l", "i", "c", "e", " ", "o", "f", "f", "i", "c", "e", "r", "s", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "i", "n", ",", " ", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "p", "o", "l", "i", "t", "e", "l", "y", "